# Mood Indigo Coordinator Portal

Build a single-page coordinator portal for Mood Indigo (IIT Bombay's cultural fest). The design draws from the **2025 theme: "A Vortex of Vandalism"** — punk-inspired, gritty, high-contrast, rebellious energy with textured backgrounds.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Loading Animation Placeholder**: You mentioned you'll add the Mood Indigo intro animation later. I'll create a skeleton loading screen with a fade-out transition that you can swap in your custom animation. Does that work?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Theme Direction**: The 2025 Mood Indigo theme was **"A Vortex of Vandalism"** — punk aesthetic, gritty textures, neon accents on dark backgrounds, distressed typography. I'll use this as the design language. If you want a different vibe (cleaner, more ethnic like 2024's "Enigma of Ethnicity"), let me know.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Quiz Content**: The 6 quiz cards need questions and corresponding statements. I'll put in **placeholder questions** related to Mood Indigo (e.g., "What does Mood Indigo mean to you?") — you can replace these with your actual content. Sound good?

## Open Questions

1. **Which departments** should appear in the department cards section? I'll use these 6 based on research:
   - Competitions & LYP
   - Hospitality & PR
   - Informals, Streets & Workshops
   - Pronites
   - Creatives, Design & Web
   - Marketing & Sponsorship

   Should I use different departments or add/remove any?

2. **Mood Indigo logo** — do you have the logo file, or should I use a text-based logo for now?

3. **Quiz questions** — do you have the 6 questions and reveal statements ready, or should I use placeholders?

