## Tech Stack

| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| **React 19** (via Vite) | UI framework |
| **Tailwind CSS v4** | Utility-first styling |
| **Framer Motion** | Scroll animations, card flips, carousel, page transitions |
| **Google Fonts (Outfit + Space Grotesk)** | Typography |

---

## Proposed Changes

### Project Setup

#### [NEW] Vite + React project initialization

- `npx -y create-vite@latest ./ --template react`
- Install dependencies: `tailwindcss`, `framer-motion`, `@tailwindcss/vite`
- Configure Tailwind v4 with custom theme tokens (colors, fonts)

---

### Section 1 — Loading Screen

#### [NEW] `src/components/LoadingScreen.jsx`

- Full-screen overlay with dark background
- Animated "MOOD INDIGO" text with glitch/flicker effect
- Placeholder container where user can later drop in their custom animation
- Auto-dismisses after 3 seconds with a smooth fade-out
- Uses `AnimatePresence` from Framer Motion for exit animation

---

### Section 2 — Hero Section

#### [NEW] `src/components/HeroSection.jsx`

**Layout:**
- Split layout: left side = text content, right side = hero image
- Mood Indigo logo positioned top-left or centered above the text
- Staggered text reveal animation on scroll-into-view

**Left side:**
- Festival title with distressed/bold typography
- 2-3 line description of Mood Indigo (Asia's largest college cultural festival)
- CTA button (e.g., "Explore Departments")

**Right side:**
- Generated hero image depicting the festival energy
- Image with a grunge mask/clip-path for non-rectangular framing

**Background:**
- Animated floating particles (subtle, punk-themed — like paint splatter dots)
- Noise texture overlay via CSS `background-image` with SVG filter
- Subtle grid lines fading in/out

---

### Section 3 — Department Cards

#### [NEW] `src/components/DepartmentSection.jsx`
#### [NEW] `src/components/DepartmentCard.jsx`

**Layout:**
- Section title: "DEPARTMENTS" with accent line
- 2×3 or 3×2 responsive grid of department cards
- Each card contains: department icon/emoji, name, brief description

**Animations (Framer Motion):**
- Cards stagger-fade-in as user scrolls into viewport (`whileInView`)
- Subtle hover: card lifts (translateY), border glows with accent color
- Minimal, clean cards with dark glass morphism (semi-transparent backgrounds)

**Design:**
- Dark card backgrounds (`rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.8)`) with thin neon border
- Accent colors vary per card (neon pink, acid green, yellow, red, cyan, purple)
- Monospace or bold sans-serif text

---

### Section 4 — Interactive Quiz Carousel

#### [NEW] `src/components/QuizSection.jsx`
#### [NEW] `src/components/QuizCarousel.jsx`
#### [NEW] `src/components/QuizCard.jsx`

This is the most complex section. Here's how it works:

**Scroll Locking:**
- When user scrolls into the quiz section, further page scroll is **blocked**
- The section takes over the viewport (100vh sticky/fixed positioning)
- Scroll unlocks only after all 6 cards are completed

**Cylindrical Carousel:**
- 3D perspective carousel using CSS `transform: rotateY()` + `translateZ()`
- Center card is fully visible and in-focus
- Left and right adjacent cards are partially visible with blur + scale-down
- Cards beyond ±1 position are hidden
- Navigation: left/right arrows (disabled until current card is answered)

**Card Behavior (each of the 6 cards):**
- **Front face**: Shows a question with a text input/multiple choice
- **Back face**: After answering, card flips (3D `rotateY(180deg)` transition) to reveal a statement/message related to the question
- **Sequential unlock**: Next card is only accessible after current card is answered and flipped
- Cards that haven't been unlocked appear locked/greyed out in the carousel

**Card Design:**
- Dark card with neon border glow
- Question text in bold, centered
- Input field or answer options styled to match the punk theme
- Flip animation: smooth 0.6s 3D rotation

**Progress Indicator:**
- Small dots or progress bar showing 1/6, 2/6, etc.
- Completed cards get a checkmark indicator

---

### Shared / Global

#### [NEW] `src/App.jsx`
- Orchestrates all sections in order
- Manages loading screen state (show/hide after animation)
- Smooth scroll behavior

#### [NEW] `src/index.css`
- Tailwind v4 imports
- Custom CSS for noise texture, scrollbar styling, global resets
- Font imports (Outfit, Space Grotesk)
- Custom animations (@keyframes for glitch, float, pulse)

#### [NEW] `src/hooks/useScrollLock.js`
- Custom hook to lock/unlock page scroll
- Used by QuizSection to trap the user until quiz is complete

#### [NEW] `src/data/departments.js`
- Static data for department cards (name, description, accent color, icon)

#### [NEW] `src/data/quizQuestions.js`
- Static data for 6 quiz questions and their corresponding reveal statements

