## Architecture Diagram

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["App.jsx"] --> B["LoadingScreen"]
    A --> C["HeroSection"]
    A --> D["DepartmentSection"]
    A --> E["QuizSection"]
    
    D --> D1["DepartmentCard ×6"]
    
    E --> E1["QuizCarousel"]
    E1 --> E2["QuizCard ×6"]
    
    E -->|uses| H["useScrollLock hook"]
    
    style B fill:#1a1a2e,stroke:#ff1493
    style C fill:#1a1a2e,stroke:#00ff41
    style D fill:#1a1a2e,stroke:#ffd700
    style E fill:#1a1a2e,stroke:#00d4ff
```

