## Design System

### Colors
| Token | Value | Usage |
|-------|-------|-------|
| `bg-primary` | `#0a0a0a` | Main background |
| `bg-card` | `#111111` | Card backgrounds |
| `text-primary` | `#f0f0f0` | Main text |
| `text-muted` | `#888888` | Secondary text |
| `accent-pink` | `#ff1493` | Primary accent |
| `accent-green` | `#00ff41` | Secondary accent |
| `accent-yellow` | `#ffd700` | Tertiary accent |
| `accent-red` | `#e83a30` | Alert accent |
| `accent-cyan` | `#00d4ff` | Cool accent |
| `accent-purple` | `#b026ff` | Sixth accent |

### Typography
- **Headings**: `Space Grotesk` — bold, slightly techy, matches punk-modern vibe
- **Body**: `Outfit` — clean, readable, modern sans-serif
- **Monospace accents**: `JetBrains Mono` for small labels/tags

### Textures
- SVG noise filter overlay (subtle grain)
- CSS `radial-gradient` for vignette effect on hero
- Thin grid lines in background (very low opacity)

---

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- `npm run build` to ensure production build passes
- `npm run dev` to verify hot reload works

### Manual Verification
- Visual check of all 4 sections in browser
- Test scroll locking behavior in quiz section
- Test card flip and sequential unlock on quiz cards
- Responsive check at mobile (375px), tablet (768px), desktop (1440px)
- Performance check — ensure animations are smooth (60fps)

### Browser Recording
- Record a full scroll-through of the site using the browser tool
- Record quiz interaction flow (answer → flip → next card)
